div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-3-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳ — שגוי.</b> הוציאו את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x^2\\)</span> מהשורש: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\sqrt{x^2}=|x|\\)</span>, ושימו לב ש-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(|x|=-x\\)</span> כאשר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\)</span> שלילי.</div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["a", "n2", "num", "p", "q", "r", "r2", "rad", "taM", "taP", "tw", "tw2"], "nvariants": 50}